<h2>5. Lesson 2 - How To Collect Data</h2>
<p>Collecting data is just writing down what you see!</p>
<p><b>Step 1 - Ask a Question:</b> e.g. What is the favourite food in Ruiru?</p>
<p><b>Step 2 - Ask 5 People:</b> Write their answers in a notebook.</p>
<p><b>Step 3 - Count:</b> Chapati = 3, Rice = 1, Ugali = 1</p>
<p><b>Step 4 - Decide:</b> Most people love Chapati! So if you open a food stall, sell Chapati!</p>
<p><b>Your Task Today:</b> Ask 3 friends: What is your favourite colour? Write it down. You just collected data!</p>
<button onclick="alert('Great job! You are now a Data Collector!')">I Collected Data!</button>
